#
# The tests' extra dependencies, installed only in the image's test target;
# pinned and hashed into requirements-test.txt as requirements.in explains.
-c requirements.txt
# The tests' HTTP client (httpx2.AsyncClient on its ASGI transport, the deployment
# probes) and the one Starlette's TestClient is built on: Starlette 1.x wants httpx2,
# Pydantic's fork of httpx 0.28, and warns on httpx (PLK-3). The server itself makes
# its few outgoing requests (OIDC) with urllib and has no HTTP client dependency.
httpx2
